#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "You need at least one circuit as the input to the Sampler primitive.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ai nevoie de cel puțin un circuit ca intrare pentru primitiva Sampler.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Define a QASM quantum circuit:\n"
msgstr "Definește un circuit cuantic QASM:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
